# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, regardless of the platform a
# contributor works on. Without this, a Windows checkout re-writes every file as
# CRLF and the next commit from macOS or CI shows the whole file as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
